	"Description": "Open-source Mover traversal for UE 5.8: mantle, ledge hang and ladders as real, networked Mover movement modes, with animation data for your own Anim Blueprint, a ladder actor, a ready-made pawn and a demo course. Foothold Pro adds climbing, glide, wall-run, slide, the animation nodes and the GASP setup.",
